      "correct": [
        String.raw`F`,
        String.raw`T`,
        String.raw`F`,
        String.raw`T`
      ],
      "explain": String.raw`<b>a) Sai.</b> $a = \sqrt{b^2 + c^2 - 2bc\cos A} = \sqrt{7^2 + 5^2 - 2\cdot 7\cdot 5\cos 120^\circ} = \sqrt{109}\text{ (cm)}$.<br><b>b) Đúng.</b> $\cos C = \dfrac{a^2 + b^2 - c^2}{2ab} = \dfrac{109 + 7^2 - 5^2}{2\sqrt{109}\cdot 7} \approx 0,91$.<br><b>c) Sai.</b> $\cos B = \dfrac{a^2 + c^2 - b^2}{2ac} = \dfrac{109 + 5^2 - 7^2}{2\sqrt{109}\cdot 5} \approx 0,81$.<br><b>d) Đúng.</b> $R = \dfrac{a}{2\sin A} = \dfrac{\sqrt{109}}{2\sin 120^\circ} = \dfrac{\sqrt{327}}{3} \approx 6,03\text{ (cm)}$.`
